{"id":"442520","name":"羊汤","author":"tgcyy","authorId":"7015271","desc":"","cover":"images/442520/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"羊肉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1段"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"老陈醋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"芝麻油","amount":"几滴"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"原料。","img":"images/442520/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"羊肉切块。","img":"images/442520/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"羊肉焯水，洗净备用。","img":"images/442520/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"调料盒里放花椒。","img":"images/442520/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"电压力锅里放葱、姜、调料盒、加适量水。","img":"images/442520/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放羊肉，上汽后煮20分钟。","img":"images/442520/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"压力锅排气后放胡萝卜。","img":"images/442520/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"胡萝卜煮软。","img":"images/442520/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放盐、胡椒粉、芝麻油、葱末、香菜、老陈醋调味即可。","img":"images/442520/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"我习惯放一点点老陈醋，如果您不喜欢，也可以不放。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}